# East to west (2026-10-26): clocks from the CMT_L BUFGCEs cross X15 the other
# way. designs/kv260_cmt_char (58 specimens, direction from the driver's
# column): the REV pip sets 12_(47-2k), and a used R side 13_(46-2k), for all
# of tracks 1-23 (3-12 instances each); track 0 (the PS clock's in every
# specimen) follows the pattern. FWD's own 13_(46-2k) is the R side's.
RCLK_CLEM_CLKBUF_L.PIP.CLK_HROUTE_R0.CLK_HROUTE_L0.REV add-feature 12_47  # inferred
